# Three-cushion long-rail natural-angle practice layout.
# Goal: exercise a longer rail-first trace on the 10 ft carom table without pocket or jaw events.
table three_cushion_carom_10ft
game three_cushion
ball cue at (3.15, 2.10)
ball yellow at (2.05, 4.45)
ball red at (0.80, 6.85)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.08)
simulation(default)
  .preset(three_cushion)
  .max_events(16)
trace(max_events: 16)
shot(cue).heading(302deg).speed(102ips).tip(side: 0.10R, height: 0.20R).using(default)
